{"name": "Hi-Fi Roller", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203370/extras_big/7c9938c627d35cec58756e607bef21f3.webp?t=1787114535\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203370/extras/7c9938c627d35cec58756e607bef21f3.avif?t=1787114535\" width=\"1560\"/></span>Roll, jump, and race through a tinkerer\u2019s workshop turned obstacle course. Master a vast miniature world of circuit boards, wires, and contraptions in this photo-realistic marble platformer built for skill and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hi-Fi graphics\u2728, Lo-Fi beats \ud83c\udfa7, all chill vibes\ud83d\ude0e.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Bumpy Roads</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nobody said it would be completely smooth rolling. There are many obstacles that will get in your way. Roll, Die, Repeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"252\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203370/extras/a4b1711c59e7a7768bfdfb58210c2a74.poster.avif?t=1787114535\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4203370/extras/a4b1711c59e7a7768bfdfb58210c2a74.webm?t=1787114535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfc1 Will You Rise to the Top?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Score high in time trials. Compete globally. Top the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"252\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https: